--> Task 1.3: Navigation bar and header
Purpose of AI Use: Used Copilot in VS Code to generate blue and white themed code to style the navigation bar and header, using the template generated by ChatGPT in Task 1.1.
Chat Link or Prompt/Response: The original Copilot chat is not available (the session history could not be recovered). The prompt, as best I remember, was to generate the CSS for the project's files based on the uploaded design image. The exact wording cannot be confirmed.
AI-Suggested Content: It generated a blue-and-white themed CSS stylesheet to style the navigation bar and header: blue fixed header, white vertical sidebar, white hamburger toggle.
Validation: Applied the suggested code and opened the page in the browser to see if the changes made sense.
Decision: Accepted all CSS code for the navigation bar. For the styling of the header, the size of the logo was made smaller and all other changes were accepted.
Reflection: AI saved time on the repetitive styling and gave a consistent blue and white theme. It is a good starting point, but I still need to review its output.
Responsible person: Ariane

